@startuml student_invitation_flow
title Add Student by Invitation - UML Sequence Diagram

hide footbox

actor Tutor
participant API
participant InviteStudentHandler
database Database
participant OutboxProcessor
participant RabbitMqPublisher
queue RabbitMQ
participant EmailConsumer
participant EmailEventDispatcher
participant StudentInvitationCreatedEmailHandler
participant SmtpMailer
participant "SMTP / Mailpit" as Mailpit
actor Student
participant AcceptStudentInvitationHandler

Tutor -> API: POST /api/tutors/me/student-invitations
API -> InviteStudentHandler: InviteStudentCommand

InviteStudentHandler -> Database: Check active agreement for Tutor+Recipient

InviteStudentHandler -> Database: Load previous Created/Sent invitations\nfor Tutor+Recipient
Database --> InviteStudentHandler: Previous active invitations
InviteStudentHandler -> InviteStudentHandler: Mark previous invitations Expired

InviteStudentHandler -> InviteStudentHandler: Generate raw token + TokenHash
InviteStudentHandler -> InviteStudentHandler: Create StudentInvitation
InviteStudentHandler -> InviteStudentHandler: Create StudentInvitationCreatedIntegrationEvent

InviteStudentHandler -> Database: Save expired invitations\n+ new StudentInvitation (TokenHash only)\n+ OutboxMessage (raw token in payload)

note right of Database
Previous active invitations are preserved
for history but marked Expired.

The new StudentInvitation and its
OutboxMessage are persisted in the
same SaveChangesAsync call.
end note

InviteStudentHandler --> API: InvitationUrl (raw token)
API --> Tutor: 200 OK + invitation link

== Asynchronous email delivery ==

OutboxProcessor -> Database: Load unprocessed OutboxMessage
Database --> OutboxProcessor: student-invitations.created.v1

OutboxProcessor -> RabbitMqPublisher: Publish event
RabbitMqPublisher -> RabbitMQ: Publish student-invitations.created.v1
RabbitMqPublisher --> OutboxProcessor: Publish confirmed

OutboxProcessor -> Database: Mark OutboxMessage ProcessedAtUtc

RabbitMQ -> EmailConsumer: Deliver invitation event
EmailConsumer -> EmailEventDispatcher: Dispatch event
EmailEventDispatcher -> StudentInvitationCreatedEmailHandler: Handle payload

StudentInvitationCreatedEmailHandler -> StudentInvitationCreatedEmailHandler: Build invitation URL
StudentInvitationCreatedEmailHandler -> StudentInvitationCreatedEmailHandler: Render email template
StudentInvitationCreatedEmailHandler -> SmtpMailer: Send invitation email
SmtpMailer -> Mailpit: SMTP message
Mailpit --> Student: Invitation email with link

EmailConsumer -> RabbitMQ: ACK

== Invitation acceptance ==

Student -> API: POST /api/student-invitations/{token}/accept
API -> AcceptStudentInvitationHandler: AcceptStudentInvitationCommand

AcceptStudentInvitationHandler -> AcceptStudentInvitationHandler: Hash raw token
AcceptStudentInvitationHandler -> Database: Find StudentInvitation by TokenHash

AcceptStudentInvitationHandler -> AcceptStudentInvitationHandler: Validate ValidUntilUtc and Status

alt Invitation expired, superseded, accepted, or rejected
    AcceptStudentInvitationHandler --> API: 409 StudentInvitations.Unavailable
    API --> Student: 409 Conflict
else Invitation available
    AcceptStudentInvitationHandler -> Database: Resolve authenticated Student
    AcceptStudentInvitationHandler -> AcceptStudentInvitationHandler: Validate recipient email
    AcceptStudentInvitationHandler -> Database: Check active agreement for Tutor+Student

    AcceptStudentInvitationHandler -> Database: Create TutoringAgreement\n+ mark invitation Accepted
    AcceptStudentInvitationHandler --> API: AgreementId
    API --> Student: 200 OK
end

@enduml